      "body": "Full year 2025 results: EPS: ₹110 (down from ₹114 in FY 2024). Revenue: ₹6.60b (up 26% from FY 2024). Net income: ₹722.9m (down 1.0% from FY 2024). Profit margin: 11% (down from 14% in FY 2024). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 13% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 27% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
